 Stock-based compensation of $878K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 0\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity).","financial_summary":["HIVE Digital Technologies Ltd is a small-cap financial services business with a $368M market cap on $298M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +158% over the past three years, the kind of sustained demand persistence that marks a compounder.","Returns on capital run at -16% against a 11% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests, and -28% gross margins are typical of commodity economics where competitors can replicate the product cheaply.","The business throws off $41M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 14 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year.","Insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (1.6) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"ROIC sits in the bottom decile among Financial Services peers \u2014 no moat advantage to speak of","sev":"red","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Carries a 209% premium to sector median EV/EBITDA","sev":"amber","cat":"valuation","magnitude":2.091368621840725},{"text":"Piotroski score 4/9 \u2014 below the median for a healthy business","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Gross margin trails most Financial Services peers \u2014 competitors appear to have the pricing hand","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"News tone classified negative across 12 recent articles","sev":"amber","cat":"news"},{"text":"Credit cycles and regulatory capital \u2014 losses accumulate invisibly in good years and appear all at once, and the time to worry is when underwriting standards are loosest.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Fintech disintermediation \u2014 neobanks, embedded finance, and blockchain rails are unbundling the fee streams that traditional banks took for granted.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Shares offer a 15% margin of safety against estimated fair value","Trading near the bottom of its 52-week range \u2014 the market is offering a discount","Growing faster than most Financial Services peers \u2014 taking share inside the profit pool"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"HIVE Digital CEO Aydin Kilic Converts 450,000 RSUs into Common Shares","source":"kalkinemedia.com","link":"https://kalkinemedia.com/us/news/announcements/hive-digital-ceo-aydin-kilic-converts-450000-rsus-into-common-shares","date":"2026-11-25","timestamp":1795631900.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.296,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["leadership"]},{"title":"HIVE Digital Technologies Ltd Falls 5% As Selling Continues","source":"stockstotrade.com","link":"https://stockstotrade.com/news/hive-digital-technologies-ltd-hive-news-2026-11-20/","date":"2026-11-20","timestamp":1795181400.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":-0.374,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"HIVE Digital CFO Timothy Calveley Converts 95,000 RSUs into Common Shares in November 2026","source":"kalkinemedia.com","link":"https://kalkinemedia.com/us/news/announcements/hive-digital-cfo-timothy-calveley-converts-95000-rsus-into-common-shares-in-november-2026","date":"2026-11-17","timestamp":1794953244.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.296,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":["leadership"]},{"title":"Hive Digital CEO says its five-year-old Nvidia GPUs still produce cash flow","source":"aol.com","link":